{"t":"TEAM","made":"2026-11-13 00:57","name":"Atlassian Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","employees":13301,"hq":"Sydney, NSW, Australia","website":"https://www.atlassian.com","summary_en":"Atlassian Corporation provides a collaboration software that enables organizations to connect all teams through a system of work that unlocks productivity at scale worldwide. The company's product portfolio includes Jira, Confluence, Loom, Jira Service Management, Rovo, Bitbucket, Compass, Jira Product Discovery, Focus, Talent, Trello, and Guard. It also offers Collections, a curated sets of apps and agents built on the Atlassian cloud platform and designed to solve cross-functional customer workflows, including teamwork, service, strategy, software, and product collections. The company was founded in 2002 and is headquartered in Sydney, Australia.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Atlassian Corporation은 조직이 전 세계적으로 규모에 맞게 생산성을 높이는 작업 시스템을 통해 모든 팀을 연결할 수 있는 협업 소프트웨어를 제공합니다. 회사의 제품 포트폴리오에는 Jira, Confluence, Loom, Jira Service Management, Rovo, Bitbucket, Compass, Jira Product Discovery, Focus, Talent, Trello 및 Guard가 포함됩니다. 또한 Atlassian Cloud 플랫폼을 기반으로 구축되고 팀워크, 서비스, 전략, 소프트웨어 및 제품 컬렉션을 포함한 다기능 고객 워크플로를 해결하도록 설계된 큐레이트된 앱 및 에이전트 세트인 컬렉션도 제공합니다. 이 회사는 2002년에 설립되었으며 호주 시드니에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":151.32,"mcap":38304968704.0,"pe":458.54547,"fpe":22.5957,"peg":1.5884,"ps":5.541883,"pb":41.89369,"ev_ebitda":56.52,"div":0.0,"beta":1.141,"hi52":229.96,"lo52":56.01},"fin":{"rev":6911904768.0,"rev_g":0.237,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.85834,"op":0.07598,"net":0.01284,"roe":0.07754,"fcf":1997373952.0,"cash":1120504064.0,"debt":1226968064.0,"de":134.733,"eps":0.33,"feps":6.69685},"own":{"short":0.0499,"inst":1.05619,"insider":0.00681},"analyst":{"n":31,"mean":216.94258,"median":204.0,"high":480.0,"low":150.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.54545,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":6,"buy":21,"hold":6,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"peri